{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3057\u3093\u3054\u3046\u306f\u3000\u3042\u304b \u3042\u304a \u3088\u304f\u307f\u3066\u3000<i>\u30b3\u30ef\u30b7</i>\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Look carefully at the red and blue signals, and <i>DESTROY </i>them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an eccentric action puzzle game where you destroy blocks modeled after pedestrian traffic lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.mp4?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Signal blocks&quot; will appear on the board. They can be moved vertically or horizontally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Vertical blocks can only be moved vertically, and horizontal blocks can only be moved horizontally.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two or more signals of the same color touch each other, the blocks will explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal blocks in contact to the explosion will change their color due to the shock. When this creates matching colors in sequence, it forms a chain and will continue exploding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS : Earn score until game over.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE : Destroy a targeted number of blocks on the board of various shapes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME LIMIT : Reach hi-score within the time by chain destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCORE RACE : Compete by the time taken to earn a target score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BATTLE : Can compete offline with one PC.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has EASY, NORMAL, and HARD courses, so you can play at a difficulty level that matches your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying traffic lights in real life is prohibited by law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WELCOME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/cee27c7ecf8fb3df74adb513c65b1c4b924d3c32.jpg"},{"name":"5 CHAIN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/4f914b4b5eff53364f55acd81952edb3aeea5ffa.jpg"},{"name":"7 CHAIN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/1e6c9a1da5e994b001952332228dd51a39eb1666.jpg"},{"name":"ALL STAGE EASY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/9edf61671a0e7f682b7da512d6e5382cfd58050c.jpg"},{"name":"ALL STAGE NORMAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/9edf61671a0e7f682b7da512d6e5382cfd58050c.jpg"},{"name":"ALL STAGE HARD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/9edf61671a0e7f682b7da512d6e5382cfd58050c.jpg"},{"name":"MEDAL EL_E","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/a445da23e06c28464d6848f5e4fefc5f27d7512a.jpg"},{"name":" \tMEDAL EL_N","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/a445da23e06c28464d6848f5e4fefc5f27d7512a.jpg"},{"name":"MEDAL EL_H","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/a445da23e06c28464d6848f5e4fefc5f27d7512a.jpg"},{"name":"MEDAL ST_E","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506550/a445da23e06c28464d6848f5e4fefc5f27d7512a.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506550?t=1761564080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506550?t=1761564080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/a8a15f425393d31426a825432a1a59f716c9c22e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761564080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/a8a15f425393d31426a825432a1a59f716c9c22e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761564080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3705070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3057\u3093\u3054\u3046\u306f\u3000\u3042\u304b \u3042\u304a \u3088\u304f\u307f\u3066\u3000<i>\u30b3\u30ef\u30b7</i>\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Look carefully at the red and blue signals, and <i>DESTROY </i>them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an eccentric action puzzle game where you destroy blocks modeled after pedestrian traffic lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.mp4?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Signal blocks&quot; will appear on the board. They can be moved vertically or horizontally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Vertical blocks can only be moved vertically, and horizontal blocks can only be moved horizontally.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two or more signals of the same color touch each other, the blocks will explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal blocks in contact to the explosion will change their color due to the shock. When this creates matching colors in sequence, it forms a chain and will continue exploding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS : Earn score until game over.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE : Destroy a targeted number of blocks on the board of various shapes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME LIMIT : Reach hi-score within the time by chain destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCORE RACE : Compete by the time taken to earn a target score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BATTLE : Can compete offline with one PC.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has EASY, NORMAL, and HARD courses, so you can play at a difficulty level that matches your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying traffic lights in real life is prohibited by law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NEO\u30bf\u30b1\u30c8\u30f3\u30dc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/header.jpg?t=1761564080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3506550/826646/760f